data: {"level":2,"reviewed":{"level":2,"label":"formula / approach","text":"Use `p1 = p_baseline`, `p2 = p1 + mde` and `pbar = (p1 + p2) / 2`. The critical value is\n`z_a = Φ⁻¹(1 − alpha / 2)` and the power term is `z_b = Φ⁻¹(power)`. Then\n`n = (z_a · sqrt(2·pbar·(1 − pbar)) + z_b · sqrt(p1(1 − p1) + p2(1 − p2)))² / mde²`. Return `ceil(n)`."},"hints_note":null}

